  "task_html": "<div style='margin:10px 0 14px;'><iframe width='100%' style='aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;border:none;display:block;' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/TPOc0kgfkCU' title='Additionsverfahren erklärt' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe></div><div style='background:#fffbeb;border:1.5px solid #fde68a;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:10px 0;'><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'><strong>Idee:</strong> Ein drittes Lösungsverfahren ist das <em>Additionsverfahren</em>: Wenn eine Variable in beiden Gleichungen mit entgegengesetztem Vorzeichen vorkommt, kannst du beide Gleichungen addieren – so fällt diese Variable weg und nur noch eine Unbekannte bleibt übrig.</p></div><div style='background:#f8f8f8;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px;margin:12px 0;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 12px;color:#374151;'>Beispiel: &nbsp; (I) 3x+2y=16 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II) 3x&minus;2y=8</p><div style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:8px 0;'><span style='background:#d97706;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:22px;height:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;'>1</span><span style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;'>Die y-Koeffizienten sind entgegengesetzt: &nbsp;<strong>+2y</strong> in (I) und <strong>&minus;2y</strong> in (II).</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:8px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:22px;height:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;'>2</span><span style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;'>Gleichungen addieren (I)+(II): &nbsp;<span style='background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;'>3x+2y</span> + <span style='background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;'>3x&minus;2y</span> = 16+8 &rarr; das y fällt weg</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:8px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:22px;height:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;'>3</span><span style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;'>Vereinfachen &amp; lösen: &nbsp; 6x=24 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; <strong>x = 4</strong></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:8px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:22px;height:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;'>4</span><span style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;'>x = 4 in (I) einsetzen: &nbsp; 3&middot;4+2y=16 &rarr; 12+2y=16 &rarr; <strong>y = 2</strong></span></div><div style='background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 12px;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;'>&#x2713; Lösung: <strong>(4&nbsp;|&nbsp;2)</strong> &nbsp; Probe in (II): 3&middot;4&minus;2&middot;2=8 &#x2713;</div></div><hr style='margin:16px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #ddd;'><p style='font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:8px 0;'>Jetzt du! Löse mit dem Additionsverfahren:</p><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:10px 0 4px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 2px;color:#1e3a8a;'>Aufgabe 1</p><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>(I) 2x+3y=18 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II) x&minus;3y=&minus;9</p></div><div style='font-size:13px;line-height:2.4;padding:2px 0 8px;'>&#x2460; Gleichungen addieren (I)+(II): &nbsp; <span style='background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'>2x+3y</span> + <span style='background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'>x&minus;3y</span> = 18+(&minus;9) &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; vereinfacht: 3x = 9<br>&#x2461; x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:70px;display:inline-block;' data-ans='3' placeholder='?'><br>&#x2462; y: 2x+3y=18 &rarr; 2&middot;3+3y=18 &rarr; y = <input class='cell-input' style='width:70px;display:inline-block;' data-ans='4' placeholder='?'></div><div style='background:#fef9c3;border-left:3px solid #fde68a;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#78350f;margin:10px 0;'>📝 Ab jetzt: Rechne die Zwischenschritte (Addieren, Auflösen) auf einem Blatt Papier &ndash; hier trägst du nur noch x und y ein.</div><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:10px 0 4px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 2px;color:#1e3a8a;'>Aufgabe 2</p><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>(I) 3x+2y=17 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II) 2x&minus;2y=8</p></div><div style='font-size:13px;padding:2px 0 8px;'>x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:70px;display:inline-block;' data-ans='5' placeholder='?'> &nbsp;&nbsp; y = <input class='cell-input' style='width:70px;display:inline-block;' data-ans='1' placeholder='?'></div><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:10px 0 4px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 2px;color:#1e3a8a;'>Aufgabe 3</p><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>(I) 4x+y=26 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II) 2x&minus;y=10</p></div><div style='font-size:13px;padding:2px 0 8px;'>x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:70px;display:inline-block;' data-ans='6' placeholder='?'> &nbsp;&nbsp; y = <input class='cell-input' style='width:70px;display:inline-block;' data-ans='2' placeholder='?'></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(17)'>&#x2713; Überprüfen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(17)'>&#x21BA; Zurücksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-17'></span></div>",
  "sol_html": "<p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;'><strong>Aufgabe 1:</strong> 3x=9 &rarr; x=<strong>3</strong>, y: 2&middot;3+3y=18 &rarr; 3y=12 &rarr; y=<strong>4</strong> &nbsp; Probe (II): 3&minus;12=&minus;9 &check; &nbsp; Lösung: <strong>(3|4)</strong><br><strong>Aufgabe 2:</strong> 5x=25 &rarr; x=<strong>5</strong>, y: 3&middot;5+2y=17 &rarr; 2y=2 &rarr; y=<strong>1</strong> &nbsp; Probe (II): 2&middot;5&minus;2&middot;1=8 &check; &nbsp; Lösung: <strong>(5|1)</strong><br><strong>Aufgabe 3:</strong> 6x=36 &rarr; x=<strong>6</strong>, y: 4&middot;6+y=26 &rarr; y=<strong>2</strong> &nbsp; Probe (II): 2&middot;6&minus;2=10 &check; &nbsp; Lösung: <strong>(6|2)</strong></p>",
